This ruling gives Mojave National Preserve a vital reprieve from damaging mining activities.

@RepHuffman, @SenAlexPadilla, @SenatorHeinrich, and I fought back against the Trump administration’s effort to degrade our public lands for profit.

We must continue protecting California’s beautiful open spaces — vital treasures that must be preserved for generations to come.

